      "decision_index": 118,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Drownyard Explorers could attack for 2 damage completely unblocked. All of the opponent's creatures are either tapped or have summoning sickness, meaning there are zero available blockers. At 10 life vs 20 life, every point of damage matters, especially when the opponent has a threatening board that will untap next turn.",
